WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.169
Step 1. Open the encounter.

1.2
00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:07.997
Here you change the status or the note of a medication statement saved during this

1.3
00:00:07.997 --> 00:00:11.481
encounter, or mark it as entered in error.

2.1
00:00:11.481 --> 00:00:15.669
Step 2. Open the form. Select Forms, search for the form,

2.2
00:00:15.669 --> 00:00:19.745
and select the form with the Medication Statement question.

2.3
00:00:19.745 --> 00:00:23.764
Care opens the form for the encounter.

3.1
00:00:23.764 --> 00:00:25.818
Step 3. Find the statement.

3.2
00:00:25.818 --> 00:00:31.228
The Medication Statement question shows the statements that staff recorded during

3.3
00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:35.268
this encounter. Find the one that you want to change.

4.1
00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:38.397
Step 4. Change the status or the note.

4.2
00:00:38.397 --> 00:00:41.882
Select a new Status, or edit the text in Note.

4.3
00:00:41.882 --> 00:00:46.582
The other fields of a saved statement stay read-only.

5.1
00:00:46.582 --> 00:00:49.996
Step 5. Mark a statement as entered in error.

5.2
00:00:49.996 --> 00:00:54.778
If staff recorded it by mistake, set its Status to Entered in Error.

5.3
00:00:54.778 --> 00:00:59.498
Care offers this only for a statement that was saved before.

6.1
00:00:59.498 --> 00:01:02.724
Step 6. Save the form. Select Save Changes.

6.2
00:01:02.724 --> 00:01:06.047
Care shows Questionnaire submitted successfully,

6.3
00:01:06.047 --> 00:01:11.239
and the statement marked Entered in Error no longer shows in the Medication

6.4
00:01:11.239 --> 00:01:13.054
Statements sub-tab.
